OL,3,GNEWSAAmazon driver's death 'could have
OL,4,Abeen avoided'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of an Amazon delivery driver
OL,7,Fat a level crossing in Kent could have
OL,8,Fbeen avoided with better signage and
OL,9,Fcrossing design, a rail accident
OL,10,Finvestigation has said.
OL,12,FBrandon Hatcher, 23, was killed at the
OL,13,Fscene when the van he was driving was
OL,14,Fstruck at a level crossing on Lower
OL,15,FRoad, in Teynham, on 13 July 2025.
OL,17,FThe train was travelling from Ramsgate
OL,18,Fto London Victoria at about 70mph
OL,19,F(114km/h).
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,323,320,200,140,0,100
