OL,3,GNEWSAAmazon driver's death 'could have
OL,4,Abeen avoided'
OL,5,
OL,6,FRail Accident Investigation Branch
OL,7,F(RAIB) investigators said the driver
OL,8,Fwas likely to have been misled by a
OL,9,Fgreen light into believing it was safe
OL,10,Fto enter the crossing before the exit
OL,11,Fgate had been opened.
